Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现了一颗闪着金色光芒\N不可思议的彗星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运行的轨道非常乱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只要发现行星就会立刻靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像木星 火星 地球和金星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只要发现行星就会立刻靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像活的生物一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔? 呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有这种彗星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...你一定是看错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...小木马 不能在这里奔驰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很窄的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一被人发现怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的散步就到此为止 回去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有个宽阔的牧场 那该有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个辽阔无边的牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和我的爱马史达龙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬上了小山丘上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着火红的夕阳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从地平线的那一端慢慢西沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵...这件事你到底要说几次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好事当然要多说几次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在边在说马...\N- 那么大雄你有马吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有牧场吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗? 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.21,0:01:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你现在就带我们\N去参观你的牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行 那就就今天晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚大家都要去看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又吹那种无聊的牛皮了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没有吹牛皮\N是因为小夫太骄傲 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太多事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你\N在今晚之前帮我建一个牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托帮帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上没有多余的土地了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下还有事要办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到22世纪的大拍卖\N买一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦剧场版\N发条都市冒险记
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事情真好\Nこんなこといいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以完成更好\Nできたらいいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那样的　有这样的\Nあんなゆめ　こんなゆめ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各式各样的梦想\Nいっぱいあるけど
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家　大家　大家啊\Nみんな　みんな　みんな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来帮我实现愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那个神奇的口袋\Nふしぎなポッケで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来帮我实现愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想自由自在的在天空飞翔\Nそらをじゆうに　とびたいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“来！给你竹蜻蜓！”\N“ハイ！タケコプター”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢哆啦A梦了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢哆啦A梦了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 哆啦A梦真无情\N小木马也很需要很多牧场的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚如果大家来找我\N我该怎么办呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拜托妈妈 跟他们说我不在家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真无聊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22世纪在拍卖的安慰奖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒呀安慰奖\N居然也能得到一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就在那里盖牧场吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想得太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些只是位于火星跟木星之间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上千万个没用的小星球当中\N一个毫无用处的星球罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 真是令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还是去确认看看\N拿任意门出来给我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本是白费心机的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果还不错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不可能 因为那是安慰奖呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我到SSS-LM-303星球去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...等待一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面是外太空随便跑出去\N可是不得了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适应灯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要照过这个\N到什么地方都能适应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那再来一次\N带我到SSS-LM-303星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是赠送的星球啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是早跟你说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去别的星球上看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一样 没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-LM-205星球去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺大的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 石头都松开了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才拿来当安慰奖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-OH-9984星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着是SSS-UV-207星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根本不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-NN-75112星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗星球怎么是空心的?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-VU-38454星球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-...-577...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-PQ-5745...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一张啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是技安他们 怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木马 快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说好今晚开始\N要一起做暑假作业
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一张了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 待会我再想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-BC-555
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦? 准备好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉...等一下 为了以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适应灯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 门那边真的有牧场啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己去看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哗...好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么好棒啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好像在做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是世上最棒的牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有这只马?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱 跟木玩偶一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不是玩具马啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是 它是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命发条
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要上了这个发条\N任何玩偶都能活动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的玩偶也行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的遥控车也可可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N车子会像真车一样可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我回家去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:55.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:08:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没想到安慰奖\N会有这么好的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系 既然送给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你把它们上发条吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒 就跟活的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是活的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的也要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一它发起狂来 那不是很可怕?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你敢对它差别待遇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也帮你的玩偶上发条吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然想起来\N我们可以作个玩具都市啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立发条都市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天己经很晚了\N明天开始我们的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是哆啦A梦的功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大家的玩偶都市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是发条都市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 是发条都市\N先请静香带我们去参观
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是娃娃的家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是玛丽跟莉莉小姐\N这位是杰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦用放大灯把他们放大的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有服装店面包店还有花店耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是发条都市的商店街啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫你做的呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的店在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是汽车公司\N什么车都有 静香如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要帮杰克买一部车?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他一定很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请各位来看看我的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安的公司?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安建设股份有限公司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是桥梁道路\N或是大楼的建设工程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都承包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是是玩具们他们都很认真的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在一旁监督
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很像技安的作风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 蛋差不多孵化了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是“蛋蛋屋”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想 只有小木马跟小猪他们\N会很寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是什么蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要孵化了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的在动了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马居然从蛋里孵出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么惊讶嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有这么宽敞的牧场\N当然要多一点伙伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:11:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋复制镜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上发条的玩偶只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以靠这个复制镜\N就能复制出很多相同的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一经孵化\N就会变成同样大小优良的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便增加其他动物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 很像真的牧场了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发射了一枚人造卫星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会从太空中\N把这一带的照片传送回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信箱里面应该已经有照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了这个牧场之外\N其他地方都是森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一迷了路一定走不出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是充满谜团的神秘森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是湖泊吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底下好像有个发光的物体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发光的物体?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好是大金块哦 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定了 我们去森林里探险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便带玩偶们去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦探险队出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑袋上有什么 闪闪发光\Nあたまテカテカ　さえてビカビカ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是为什么...\Nそれたどうした...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别害怕 有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是魔鬼还是狮子 都给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具变的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来世界的 猫型机器人\Nみらいのせかいの　ネコがたロボット
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管遇到什么 我是哆啦A梦\Nどんなもんだい　ぼくドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走的慢吞吞的会跟不上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就在这里吃便当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好安静 只有风声
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上可能没有这种地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁?  谁呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说“滚出去 滚出去”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有声音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你听错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有人在说话啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是树叶摩擦的声音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 有乌云飘过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上没有这种雨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好没掉到海里面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到会有大洪水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我的建设公司\N得把这里的河道挖宽点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心那些玩偶 我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 顺着河走应该就会到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被冲的好远
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋蛋屋焦掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎被雷打到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.55,0:15:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好蛋好像都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是因为冲击而掉了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好 我叫做皮姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是刚才雷电的能量造成的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头脑真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今早5点左右前科累累的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:16:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊虎鬼五郎从监狱中脱逃\N便失去了行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去告诉在2楼的孩子们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 在我们家很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他们也不希望被打扰\N好不容易才这么认真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没人在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这扇门是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没想到有这么大片的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找个藏身的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我要一口气\N把堤防的工程给完成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让这颗星球更适合住人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会教他们念书的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是他们教你才对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说这颗星球...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里到底是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯母 我们回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.71,0:17:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 麻烦你送静香回家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果碰到那个坏人\N我会把他抓起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明天见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天的堤防工程就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堤防工程?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的自由习作啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是技安建设公司\N能做出这么棒的堤防来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就算下大雨也不需要担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着再架桥来做调整公路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再建造新干线
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要盖工厂哦 我要当...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.71,0:18:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗行星上面只有这几个小孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有那扇奇妙的门...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁? 给我出来 给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这片森林真让人不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次是不是能顺利呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫波比 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦 请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然受到雷电的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你介绍些明友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋? 这里是养鸡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.71,0:19:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么? 好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处是奇怪的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一步先从这个小镇开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗我的人格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里居然有警察
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克 超速是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然才刚生出来不久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但皮姆跟波比都喜欢看书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也该来做暑假作业了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暑假作业啊 才刚放假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.17,0:20:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点高速公路就要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然暑假还有很久\N但还是每天做一点比较妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说 我才是鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我是鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是 我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把经过详细跟我说明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 从蛋里面孵化的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:21:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来那是是复制的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里啊 这里不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却可以透过一扇奇妙的门\N跟地球连接
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.13,0:22:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然伙伴增加了 那力量也变强了\N怎么样 来统治这个星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.17,0:22:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球上\N只有拥有奇妙道具的蓝色狸猫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.63,0:22:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟那四个孩子以及一些玩偶家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要抢实在太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把这个星球抢过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把树都砍光来卖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能赚好多钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 盖饭店才好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说的 赌场才好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 你们只是我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不许有意见 只要听我...不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听从我这个社长的话就行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太着急 再看看情况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.39,0:23:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在堤防上种花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是快速增长花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.89,0:23:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在高速公路两旁\N种了树 一起去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都是绿色真令人高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大雄\N- 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了很多强力的太阳能电池
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条玩偶们只要有了这个\N就没有问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.43,0:23:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根据卫星传回的相片\N画了这幅地图
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.51,0:23:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算把高速公路\N造到火山口湖那里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 今天要不要去海水浴场玩?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.01,0:23:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 万一金块\N被人捷足先登取走怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人? 谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对哦 这星球上面只有我们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个玩具船\N要不要坐在上面游河?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快点去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.89,0:23:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.22,0:24:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放大灯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.93,0:24:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经给它上了发条\N所以跟真船一样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.68,0:24:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就是船长
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.43,0:24:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.85,0:24:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条号 出航
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.05,0:24:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 黑烟是不是太多了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一定会的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.01,0:24:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.01,0:24:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的星球啊\N不会有任何人袍怨的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.35,0:24:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:24:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.39,0:25:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就是那群奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟踪他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.05,0:25:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 老大 我捡到这个 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.01,0:25:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 要叫我社长
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.85,0:25:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N是那些小孩画的地图啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.05,0:25:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 在那里有大金块
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.76,0:25:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管他们了 金块比较重要
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据这张地图
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.35,0:25:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金块的位置\N就是往这里一直走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.43,0:25:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会很远吧\N从这条路直走也要花点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.18,0:25:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在最好\N通过那道门回到地球去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢...不...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.05,0:25:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备一些食物过来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.51,0:25:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.72,0:26:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你怎么不游泳?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 大雄不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.01,0:26:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 用复制制造出来的玩偶们\N也在海底了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.39,0:26:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.18,0:26:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我用放大灯\N把鲸鱼的布偶给放大的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.01,0:26:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.89,0:26:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我的恐龙到哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.76,0:26:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它放大 打算跟它玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.72,0:26:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能在森林里睡午觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.93,0:27:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又不是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.10,0:27:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你怎么那么说我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大家的食物跟水都带齐全了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.10,0:27:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.55,0:27:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老大\N- 叫我社长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长\N因为我们都长的一样很难分辫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.01,0:27:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以请社长戴上这顶帽子\N这样比较像社长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.05,0:27:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的点子不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.35,0:27:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位朝着大金块的方向出发吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.26,0:27:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.43,0:27:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.05,0:27:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.05,0:27:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 你鼻子下面有颗黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.39,0:27:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我叫你黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.93,0:27:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.43,0:27:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.43,0:27:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我从消防署拿来的梯子\N就由你来搬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 这么重的梯子 要用来干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.51,0:28:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下就能派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.51,0:28:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中途能不能换你拿呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是社长耶 谁跟你换着拿 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.55,0:28:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.55,0:28:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好不好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.55,0:28:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们在干什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.85,0:28:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能当选市长\N我一定会尽我的全力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把发条城市建造成一个...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.05,0:28:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是在选举
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.10,0:28:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然学人类 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.01,0:28:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定不会让这个星球受到污染
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它玩偶也越来越人性化了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.43,0:28:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 这个梯子...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.43,0:28:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的分身 没有资格说话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.85,0:28:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.01,0:28:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么声音?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.85,0:29:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是玩具鹦鹉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.51,0:29:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.68,0:29:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.01,0:29:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看清楚点 那是玩偶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.68,0:29:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.85,0:29:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个都这样 这哪像我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.18,0:29:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是群胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在这里玩 快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.35,0:29:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.22,0:29:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再慢吞吞的就把你丢在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.35,0:30:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.18,0:30:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再坐一次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.18,0:30:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.18,0:31:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人怎么这么有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.89,0:32:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 是谁来了?\N我马上送果汁上去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.05,0:32:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底在研究什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.85,0:32:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.51,0:32:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一定要把桥梁架好\N给你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.43,0:32:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.01,0:32:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为有人来呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.43,0:32:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.68,0:32:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.35,0:32:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子们画的地图真的准吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.85,0:32:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.60,0:32:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大金块就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.01,0:33:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等明天天一亮\N我们就爬到山的那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.43,0:33:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就在这里扎营吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.68,0:33:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉上去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.55,0:33:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经爬过岩石山了\N只要再过了断崖
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.85,0:33:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是大金块存在之地了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.22,0:33:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起风了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.39,0:34:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.35,0:34:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这点风算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.39,0:34:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻滚出我们的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.39,0:34:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不走 就会发生很可怕的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.10,0:34:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 这里有妖怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.72,0:34:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 那只是风声
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.35,0:34:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到高速公路都完成后\N就到火口湖去寻找大金块
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.51,0:34:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.68,0:34:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我开门了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.18,0:34:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里又发生大风暴了\N等风势小一点再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.01,0:34:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.68,0:34:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别畏缩 只是打雷罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.01,0:34:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有妖怪的话就给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.55,0:35:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.89,0:35:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 因为害怕我们的勇气\N暴风雨 雷电都散开了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.85,0:35:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 马上就到大断层了 出发
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.68,0:35:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼...呼...呼...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.93,0:35:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的那场暴风雨又发生雷击了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦先生 请为我们高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.18,0:35:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为如此我们又有新成员了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.05,0:35:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就为各位介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.18,0:35:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是牛因斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.93,0:35:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是羊迪生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.26,0:35:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.55,0:35:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两只的名字真像大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.93,0:35:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始工程进度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.85,0:35:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要不要去小夫的游乐场玩?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.51,0:36:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.35,0:36:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那工程呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.10,0:36:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延期到明天再做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个公司真是没原则
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.39,0:36:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.68,0:36:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 再玩一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.51,0:36:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下我们去玩旋转木马吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.51,0:36:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 紧接着是旋转木马
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.22,0:36:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到达了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.85,0:36:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是大断层了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.89,0:36:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长这里深不见底的\N要怎么过去呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.10,0:36:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把梯子拉长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.18,0:36:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.35,0:37:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就利用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.68,0:37:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下来的时候要轻放
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.85,0:37:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 你先过去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 社长先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.85,0:37:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梯子是你搬运的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.68,0:37:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是... 快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.22,0:37:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脚抖个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.22,0:37:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看下面 一口气走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.18,0:37:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.51,0:37:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.43,0:37:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 那我就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.76,0:37:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个跟着我来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.51,0:37:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社长
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.55,0:37:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 这很简单的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.55,0:37:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就能见到大金块了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.93,0:38:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 一个晚上\N就能盖出这样的大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.60,0:38:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛不来帮忙做我的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.60,0:38:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你也能设计音乐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.43,0:38:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.10,0:38:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦先生 你们来的正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点事想拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.01,0:38:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.01,0:38:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.39,0:38:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们两位\N别再破坏这个星球的环境
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.72,0:38:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们? 什么时候?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.55,0:38:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫的车辆和船只所排放的废气\N都污染了空气
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.05,0:38:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望可以利用哆啦A梦先生的\N太阳能电池 来当作能源
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.39,0:38:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 就听你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧接着是关于技安建设公司\N所造成的环境破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.72,0:39:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 那我也有话要说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.55,0:39:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还不是会盖很多大楼?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.01,0:39:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的大楼都是使用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.39,0:39:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛因斯坦博士\N所发明的新建材所建造的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.01,0:39:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我用泥土做成的陶凝土
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.72,0:39:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比用黏土制作法更简单
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.60,0:39:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也比铁更轻更耐用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.76,0:39:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是种无毒害的物质
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.10,0:39:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我放弃进行工程
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.85,0:39:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.10,0:39:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.18,0:39:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢两位愿意为这个星球着想
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.89,0:39:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出精神来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.85,0:39:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.72,0:39:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管我 我失去活下去的目标了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.35,0:39:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们来举办技安的独唱会\N热闹一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.22,0:39:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.93,0:40:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 他好像没听到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.76,0:40:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我们帮他找回恐龙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.60,0:40:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我都忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.51,0:40:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.05,0:40:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 他心情变好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.93,0:40:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是精力旺盛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙 小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.72,0:40:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.60,0:40:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有其它玩偶到过森林里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.18,0:40:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.89,0:40:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会不会不想出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.22,0:40:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.68,0:40:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是它最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.22,0:40:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我倒不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.05,0:40:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.85,0:40:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找都没找到\N它到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.89,0:41:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 我放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.18,0:41:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带了这个来\N我们坐太空船到宇宙去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.10,0:41:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那种玩具怎么可能找到?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.26,0:41:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这哪是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.18,0:41:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给它上过发条 真的可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.35,0:41:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果到宇宙上空去找
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定很快就能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.68,0:41:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 放大灯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.55,0:41:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.22,0:41:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.35,0:41:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.85,0:41:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是一场大冒险\N最好带点水和粮食去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.55,0:41:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.85,0:41:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 技安 你总算有精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.60,0:41:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上来做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.05,0:42:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.01,0:42:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到了 大金块的湖
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.43,0:42:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要过了今夜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.51,0:42:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就成了亿万富翁了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.68,0:42:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先派个人去观察地形
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.35,0:42:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 黑痣 黑痣...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.01,0:42:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是叫我黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.60,0:42:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家明明叫做熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.26,0:42:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少让我尿尿先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.60,0:42:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打算怎么搬大金块呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.93,0:42:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.18,0:43:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.85,0:43:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到哪去了? 黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.01,0:43:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有只巨大的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.26,0:43:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是睡糊涂了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.26,0:43:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.01,0:43:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说那些了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.43,0:43:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去调查一下湖底的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.85,0:43:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 我只是你的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.35,0:43:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是知道我不会游泳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.85,0:43:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有氧气桶 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.51,0:43:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面的情况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.68,0:43:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠 有眼珠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.93,0:43:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠 那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.68,0:44:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.43,0:45:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大断层
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.85,0:45:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点爬到岩石山上去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.26,0:45:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要爬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.22,0:45:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长这里有个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.60,0:45:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 先躲起来再说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.01,0:45:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.39,0:45:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.93,0:45:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.18,0:45:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没有办法进来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.10,0:46:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然进不来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.35,0:46:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.55,0:46:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.55,0:46:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.89,0:46:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.43,0:46:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.10,0:47:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 它没追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.85,0:47:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到它这么快就故弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.85,0:47:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 我们回地球去吧\N这种星球我已经受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.68,0:47:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胆小鬼 这样还算是我的分身吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.85,0:47:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.68,0:47:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.35,0:47:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里居然有火箭\N一定是那些小孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.72,0:47:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能不好好利用\N那只蓝色狸猫呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.60,0:47:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐火箭找小恐龙时\N顺便探查这个星球的秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.45,0:47:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你带这么多东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.10,0:47:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕有什么万一
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.01,0:47:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就把所有遥控车\N都上了发条带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.01,0:47:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.18,0:47:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒险常会有的事啊 对吧 技安
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.51,0:47:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.85,0:47:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我看到森林里面有黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.55,0:48:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里面有很多玩偶的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.60,0:48:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怎么有那么大的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.55,0:48:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.72,0:48:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.89,0:48:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是你啊 我好担心\N你上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.35,0:48:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.05,0:48:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我一样个性都那么的内向
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.18,0:48:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.72,0:48:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点抓住它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.22,0:48:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙性格很像我 它是很温柔的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.43,0:48:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.68,0:48:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.76,0:48:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弟弟?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.18,0:48:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们等一下要在这个星球上探险
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.51,0:48:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要一起去?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.68,0:48:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 你喜欢森林啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.85,0:48:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.05,0:48:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么大怎么进去火箭里面
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然分手 让我很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.51,0:48:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要你幸福就好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.51,0:49:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好的活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.68,0:49:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.43,0:49:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.85,0:49:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.01,0:49:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 小夫 我们出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.68,0:49:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.22,0:49:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把行李拿上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.51,0:49:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.22,0:49:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这火箭现在属于我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.85,0:49:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最好乖乖的听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.18,0:49:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么恶心的玩偶是谁带来的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.85,0:49:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 这不是我的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.93,0:49:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了你们一定会大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.72,0:49:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是前科累累的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.35,0:49:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全痴累累?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.68,0:49:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是前科累累的熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.18,0:49:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.51,0:50:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是电视播报的...逃狱的犯人?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.01,0:50:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.43,0:50:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.22,0:50:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.72,0:50:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.85,0:50:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多个鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.85,0:50:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫 投降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.89,0:50:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你休想得逞 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.22,0:50:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.26,0:50:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 他们居然会飞 快点去追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.01,0:50:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会有那么多鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.76,0:50:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是利用复制镜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他为何会到这个星球来?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.85,0:50:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好像常常得跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.18,0:50:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 怎么办好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.01,0:50:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不把他们从这个星球上赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.35,0:50:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条城市一定会被他破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.26,0:50:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们引离市中心远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.18,0:50:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.93,0:50:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们往岩石山方向飞去了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.10,0:50:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.76,0:50:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是岩石山\N又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.93,0:50:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是岩石山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.68,0:50:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.85,0:51:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.10,0:51:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.10,0:51:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.05,0:51:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有没有可以替换?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.26,0:51:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.68,0:51:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 快撞到岩石山了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.18,0:51:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.05,0:51:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一那个金块怪物又出现
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.18,0:51:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.76,0:51:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那群孩子可以对付的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.51,0:51:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就算用强硬的手段\N也要他们听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.89,0:51:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在这里说废话 快点去追
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.35,0:51:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.68,0:51:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.35,0:51:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没电了 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.85,0:51:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才真是好危险
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.93,0:51:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果掉到大断层 那就铁定没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.55,0:51:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会追到这里来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.72,0:51:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面架了个梯子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.35,0:52:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁架的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.10,0:52:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.76,0:52:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.43,0:52:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.89,0:52:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这条路可以走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.51,0:52:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 他们要过梯子了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.39,0:52:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前把他们给抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.35,0:52:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.85,0:52:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.51,0:52:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别推我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.60,0:52:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.22,0:52:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.43,0:52:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裙子给卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.85,0:52:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你别动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.18,0:52:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大雄\N- 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.10,0:52:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.60,0:52:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.89,0:52:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.72,0:52:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.55,0:52:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.10,0:52:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他...为了要救我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.93,0:52:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.55,0:53:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.05,0:53:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你真是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.05,0:53:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼们 快点乖乖的投降
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.43,0:53:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐 放开静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.22,0:53:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.18,0:53:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.10,0:53:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然会被他给杀死的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.76,0:53:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.85,0:53:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开她
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.26,0:53:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.18,0:53:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.35,0:53:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是黄金大魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.01,0:53:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃阿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.43,0:53:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了了 大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.51,0:53:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.51,0:53:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 有没有什么道具
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.51,0:53:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮我们逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.51,0:53:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.55,0:53:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这个 也不是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.22,0:54:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.51,0:54:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类客车转换器
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.72,0:54:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊五郎先生 快点把烟囱放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.51,0:54:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.01,0:54:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是客车啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.39,0:54:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 吃一个炭糖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.26,0:54:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.43,0:54:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位坐好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.18,0:54:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.35,0:54:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.85,0:54:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.22,0:54:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.72,0:55:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它应该不会追到这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.35,0:55:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我们得把它击败
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.35,0:55:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫有没有什么武器
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.68,0:55:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我不是狸猫\N而是猫形状的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.18,0:55:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 他们有这个耶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.51,0:55:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的遥控汽车
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.76,0:55:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 这种玩具能干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.05,0:55:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是可以用哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.93,0:56:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你有个奇妙的手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.26,0:56:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.18,0:56:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么? 放手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.51,0:56:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是叫你放手了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.26,0:56:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 好像有东西\N从岩石山那里飞过来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.68,0:56:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果坐视不理的话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.05,0:56:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们创造出来的都市
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.43,0:56:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.18,0:56:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.35,0:56:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 是黄金独角仙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.26,0:56:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄金独角仙?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.26,0:56:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是魔神啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.51,0:56:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以任意的变幻自己的外形
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.51,0:56:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.85,0:56:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭会被它毁掉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.55,0:56:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它拼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.51,0:56:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好放大灯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.05,0:57:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.35,0:57:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.22,0:57:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 帮我的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.85,0:57:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.68,0:57:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.55,0:57:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么它不反击呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.68,0:57:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 你们挺行的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.39,0:57:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这方面我还有点自信
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.01,0:57:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碎成小块了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.51,0:57:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就比较方便搬运多了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.01,0:57:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来那个怪物只是外强中虚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:58:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些金块怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.43,0:58:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要变身了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.35,0:58:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.85,0:58:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.18,0:58:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能这么快就认输
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.39,0:58:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.18,0:58:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的遥控车
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.76,0:58:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 会被压扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.05,0:58:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥控车...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.89,0:58:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进来火箭里面
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.26,0:59:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底那一个是发射按钮?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.35,0:59:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.26,0:59:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它一定没办法追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.35,0:59:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.26,0:59:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闯了大祸了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.43,0:59:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这火箭只不过是玩具啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.26,0:59:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多人坐在上面\N燃料一下子就会用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.39,0:59:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 现在就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.10,0:59:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羊迪生博士的发明发表会
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.72,0:59:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我发明的空气清净机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这部清净机能让我们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.89,1:00:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有跟森林树木赖以生存的空气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.26,1:00:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持一定程度的清洁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.68,1:00:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 请博士拉动祝贺的彩球
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.68,1:00:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子 你干嘛恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.18,1:00:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点下来 小猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.05,1:00:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.51,1:00:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子\N你不能随便帮玩具上发条的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.10,1:00:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不是拿来玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.51,1:00:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们送回原来的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.05,1:01:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们好可怜峨
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.01,1:01:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.10,1:01:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就准许他们住在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.68,1:01:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 那个发条是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.93,1:01:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻还给哆啦A梦先生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.05,1:01:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动啊 这部坏机器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.85,1:01:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是坏机器呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.51,1:01:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你快点想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.51,1:01:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你擅自将它发射的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.51,1:01:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这只蓝色狸猫居然这么凶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.55,1:01:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.51,1:01:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.60,1:01:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.26,1:01:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.85,1:01:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你一定要平安无事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.93,1:02:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.26,1:02:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到5楼的玩具销售部
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.85,1:02:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不巧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.10,1:02:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这部电梯正要开往地下室去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.43,1:02:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那请让我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.93,1:02:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.68,1:02:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.10,1:02:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你那么想出去\N那我就让你出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.26,1:02:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.18,1:02:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.76,1:02:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.80,1:02:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 你好过份\N居然丢下我就跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.60,1:02:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳...好多的废气
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.01,1:03:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.14,1:03:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊快来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.64,1:03:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来救我 哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.43,1:03:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁 敢向我挑战
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.60,1:03:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是神枪手大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.60,1:03:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是嚣张的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 怎么能让你抢走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.93,1:03:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那么美丽的女孩呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.93,1:03:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神枪手大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.97,1:03:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于神枪手获得胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.93,1:03:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而保佑了发条都市的和平
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.68,1:03:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.51,1:03:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢歉 我刚才跑进你内心里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.47,1:03:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的内心?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.85,1:04:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 真正的你在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.60,1:04:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死掉了啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.01,1:04:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你只是晕过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.26,1:04:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.68,1:04:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是播种人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.76,1:04:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球的造物主
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.60,1:04:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造物主?  就是神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.18,1:04:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太一样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.76,1:04:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来神是这样子的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.10,1:04:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们其实没有真正的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.26,1:04:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是为了让人类更容易了解
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.93,1:04:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才会变换外形
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.10,1:04:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我有什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.64,1:04:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能听听我的心声
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.18,1:04:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是先让我出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.43,1:04:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他们会很担心的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.18,1:04:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要说的是很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.93,1:04:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要如何从这么高的陀螺\N回到地面上呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.76,1:04:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是陀螺 是我的太空站
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.60,1:04:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是很棒的设计
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.10,1:04:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这也不是回到地面上的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:04:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个里面有很多装置
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.26,1:05:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最好边调查地面情况\N再一边想对策
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.26,1:05:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你如何 快点给我想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.60,1:05:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.85,1:05:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说那种不负责任的话
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.85,1:05:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 跟他吵也没用
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.64,1:05:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们在同一条船上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.93,1:05:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.18,1:05:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看监视器
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.76,1:05:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那头怪物到底哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.10,1:05:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎先生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.76,1:05:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有找到大雄?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.51,1:05:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉到大断层里的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.97,1:05:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像怪物那么大的物体还可以看到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.80,1:05:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他那么小这种监视器是找不到的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.93,1:05:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是为了救我才...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.26,1:05:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.76,1:05:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球有着奇妙的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.01,1:05:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他一定还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.60,1:05:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叔叔你跟其他鬼五郎不一样\N你人真好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.60,1:05:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.43,1:05:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 给我好好的监视
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.64,1:05:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.93,1:05:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一样是复制人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.10,1:06:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播种? 为什么要播种呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.68,1:06:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大约30亿年前
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分别在火星跟地球\N散播了生物的种子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.93,1:06:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有机物质
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.51,1:06:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是火星上却失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.10,1:06:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有生命萌芽
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.51,1:06:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却因为小行星的猛烈撞击\N使一切又化为乌有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.60,1:06:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一方面你们所住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.35,1:06:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被栽培成宇宙中\N闪烁的一个绿洲地带
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.51,1:06:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球也将要失败了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.43,1:06:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果还不知道\N发看将来人类的努力了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.18,1:06:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说 梅星上的植物\N也是你播种的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.60,1:06:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我本来想把这个星球\N当作植物的乐园
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.85,1:06:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有了今天的成果
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.60,1:06:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候你们却毁了\N这个星球的保护层闯了进来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.68,1:06:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是哆啦A梦在拍卖会上\N得到的安慰奖品
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.43,1:06:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我知道 其实是你念错了号码
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.80,1:06:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 这是最后一张
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.43,1:06:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了 等一下我再想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.51,1:06:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,SSS-BC-555
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.26,1:07:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  是333才对
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.97,1:07:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错,是333才对
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.64,1:07:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然会把3跟5搞错了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.64,1:07:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.80,1:07:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过来的人还好是你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.97,1:07:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚开始的暴风雨\N是我借给植物们力量
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.26,1:07:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想藉机赶走你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.01,1:07:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那场暴风雨是你主使的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.60,1:07:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.18,1:07:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 救了我一命的这些花草\N也是你...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.64,1:07:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那是植物们的意识
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.10,1:07:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意识?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.47,1:07:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球的植物\N可以借行动表现出想法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.35,1:07:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表示这个星球上的植物\N愿意接受你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.35,1:07:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的使命也结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.26,1:07:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以放心的把这个星球\N交给爱护大自然的你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.60,1:07:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我们?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.10,1:07:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 到下一个星球去播种
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.47,1:07:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些坏人怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.35,1:07:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你们的力量去解决
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.80,1:07:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个锻炼的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.85,1:08:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.60,1:08:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要大家同心协力\N一定能够克服的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.93,1:08:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.60,1:08:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.93,1:08:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个黄金大怪物\N它从地面上飞了起来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.93,1:08:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那马上就会追到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.64,1:08:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 要怎么办好啊?\N那马上就会追到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.80,1:08:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 要怎么办好啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.64,1:08:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么一回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.60,1:08:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向不同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.76,1:08:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.60,1:08:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来那家伙己经放弃\N所以便离开这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.68,1:08:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.93,1:08:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来\N这个星球上己经没有什么好怕的了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.01,1:08:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下那只蓝色猫咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.01,1:08:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦猫咪\N你已经想到回地面的方法了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.26,1:09:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是哆啦猫咪 我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.43,1:09:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们也很想回去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.60,1:09:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.93,1:09:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法是有啦 可是很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.18,1:09:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么方法?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.14,1:09:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法在火箭的后面产生爆作
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.43,1:09:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这个冲击力量\N火箭便会往前进
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.47,1:09:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来只要靠星球上的引力\N就能着陆了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.64,1:09:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 很简单阿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.64,1:09:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要将这个太空站引爆就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.76,1:09:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是我的太空站啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.26,1:09:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.68,1:09:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是有定时炸药吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.60,1:09:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 从工程现场偷来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.60,1:09:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说偷 说“借”知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.01,1:09:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 去准备吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.47,1:09:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.43,1:09:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 自己爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.93,1:09:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.60,1:10:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送我上去啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.80,1:10:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 谢谢你啊 叶子们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.35,1:10:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去找他们再说
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.47,1:10:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 静香 小夫 技安
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.14,1:10:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不遵守诺言
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.14,1:10:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺言?  我答应过你们什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.10,1:10:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大骗子
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.51,1:10:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我松绑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.93,1:10:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 是社长的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.64,1:10:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄可能会来救你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.14,1:10:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来 那个星球就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.14,1:10:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节省了很多时间跟力气\N轻松的就把你们干掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.76,1:10:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.93,1:10:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5分钟后就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.43,1:11:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点到火箭上面去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.60,1:11:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝福你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.43,1:11:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.18,1:11:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.93,1:11:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.26,1:11:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.93,1:11:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我不好 让他绑住了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.47,1:11:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绳子 绳子松掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.10,1:11:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.60,1:11:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏黑痣先生的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.60,1:11:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.01,1:11:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去制止它曝作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.47,1:11:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 别碰 很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.93,1:11:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间了 快点到外面去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.76,1:11:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿透圈跟适应灯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.93,1:11:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了外面\N就马上藏在其他的行星后面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.35,1:11:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.68,1:12:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他 哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.80,1:12:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.14,1:12:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要制止炸药爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.47,1:12:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以还在里面没出来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.01,1:12:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会有事?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.60,1:12:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据森林里植物们的意见
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.35,1:12:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们希望能参加本星球的\N未来计划委员会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.43,1:12:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.35,1:12:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我们以前所住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.64,1:12:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为忽视植物们的意见\N而造成大洪水
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.10,1:13:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类似乎也开始注意到这一点了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.01,1:13:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 要定居在这个星球上\N就得刻不容缓的与植物们进行对话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.26,1:13:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.18,1:13:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是火箭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.35,1:13:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会这样?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.18,1:13:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太过份了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.97,1:13:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶技术太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.43,1:13:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该是哆啦A梦先生的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.68,1:13:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是差点把玩偶们吓死
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.97,1:13:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去抗议吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.97,1:13:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦先生 这样做太过份了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.01,1:13:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.64,1:13:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是哆啦A梦先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.35,1:13:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶...哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.43,1:13:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像安全降落了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.01,1:13:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有可爱的玩偶们来迎接\N实在太令人高兴了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.10,1:13:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.10,1:14:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我好饿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.93,1:14:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不是停放火箭的地点吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.64,1:14:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 他们都到太空里去了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.76,1:14:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.26,1:14:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞到那么远 我没办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.30,1:14:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是静香的小象
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.80,1:14:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别吓我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.43,1:14:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉? 你要背我啊 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.10,1:14:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是帮了我大忙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.51,1:14:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经累坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.97,1:14:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能到镇上去\N应该就会有办法的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.93,1:14:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.35,1:14:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么鬼五郎的复制人\N会在那里监视四周呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.93,1:15:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄先生 是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.10,1:15:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镇上发生严重的事情了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.85,1:15:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 被占领?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.26,1:15:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然一架火箭从天而降
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.60,1:15:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球现在是我们的\N违抗者格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.64,1:15:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镇上被弄得乱七八槽的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.85,1:15:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你独自一只小猪\N居然也能逃了出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.18,1:15:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过到处都是他的手下\N我根本无法回去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.43,1:15:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他们没在火箭上吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.76,1:15:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.97,1:15:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有他在就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.10,1:15:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.64,1:15:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.68,1:15:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是生命发条
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.68,1:15:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是静香的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.10,1:15:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是来把发条还给你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.35,1:15:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.26,1:15:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子不知道从哪里带来的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.01,1:15:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道从哪带来的?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.26,1:16:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你利用任意门回去地球上啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.30,1:16:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.68,1:16:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 备用袋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.93,1:16:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回地球一趟
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.43,1:16:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.26,1:16:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.76,1:16:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.85,1:16:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处是那坏人的手下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.93,1:16:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子去比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.26,1:16:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.60,1:16:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它去的话不会被注意到
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.60,1:16:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且这种事它很在行的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.47,1:16:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.93,1:16:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好 是这种形状的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.60,1:16:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门一打开就是我的房间
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.60,1:16:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把门后的衣柜打开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.35,1:16:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只小猪跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.10,1:16:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.64,1:16:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能顺利的拿来呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.26,1:16:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.80,1:17:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子们不知道怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.01,1:17:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长这样做太过份了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.85,1:17:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 这里有那个东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.85,1:17:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人怀念
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.51,1:17:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候一直好想坐的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以坐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.10,1:17:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.93,1:17:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.93,1:17:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.85,1:17:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袋子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.93,1:17:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子到底知不知道什么是衣柜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.01,1:17:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 一定没有问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.60,1:17:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有了那个口袋\N就能见到他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.93,1:17:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么见?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.43,1:18:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.30,1:18:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能平安回来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.85,1:18:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那包袱里是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.76,1:18:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的内裤啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.60,1:18:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是帽子 虽然形状都一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.18,1:18:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 备用袋
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.30,1:18:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个袋子跟哆啦A梦的口袋\N是相通的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.80,1:18:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要进到这里面...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.18,1:18:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一他们在宇宙里面 适应灯
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.14,1:18:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是以防万一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.68,1:18:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.26,1:18:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快点张开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.47,1:18:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.26,1:18:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我们死在这种地方啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.76,1:18:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.68,1:18:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.85,1:19:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他醒了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.35,1:19:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然醒了 可是好像坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.10,1:19:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在我的口袋里面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.10,1:19:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.18,1:19:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.76,1:19:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.18,1:19:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.35,1:19:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.76,1:19:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我们可以回到备用袋里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.85,1:19:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不早点想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.97,1:19:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快点回发条都市去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.80,1:19:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.43,1:19:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快跳到我的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.76,1:19:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等待一下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.80,1:19:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要乱摸 赶快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.64,1:19:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.10,1:19:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都回去了 再来就剩下我了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.85,1:20:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.47,1:20:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 大家都没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.14,1:20:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条都市\N已经被鬼五郎他们给占领了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.93,1:20:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 是真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.97,1:20:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,个个都那么没用
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.01,1:20:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎怎么会因为这样就昏倒呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.26,1:20:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的看到骷髅骷颅头
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.64,1:20:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊猫从后面打我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.30,1:20:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.43,1:20:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣你留在这里监视他们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.10,1:20:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗?  是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.10,1:20:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不允许你们\N把这个星球上的木头拿去卖
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.10,1:20:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是盖旅馆饭店之类
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.35,1:20:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是这么认为
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.85,1:20:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.60,1:20:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把任意门拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.10,1:20:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.30,1:20:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是牛因斯坦跟羊迪生
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.14,1:20:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都没事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.60,1:21:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾努力想保护家园\N但最终还是输了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.43,1:21:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能想到的武器只有这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.35,1:21:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我把他们打个落花流水吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.10,1:21:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安不可能的 他们都有手枪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.68,1:21:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还好大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.76,1:21:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.51,1:21:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为了救我们\N自己又跑回去当诱饵
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.26,1:21:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果被他们给抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.80,1:21:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.43,1:21:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去救它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.93,1:21:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.85,1:21:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 有没有什么好办法
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.43,1:21:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.14,1:21:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么办法?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.35,1:21:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎以为我们死了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.85,1:21:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果需要我们帮忙就请直说
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.10,1:21:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个计划我们几个人去就够了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.10,1:22:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定把它救出来\N你们在这里等着
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.68,1:22:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石头帽子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.93,1:22:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上这项帽子 就会类似隐形了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.26,1:22:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人会发现的 快戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.43,1:22:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.93,1:22:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这发明真是伟大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.26,1:22:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在那里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.76,1:22:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你旁边
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.01,1:22:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 照我们刚才说的\N马上到市公所去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.97,1:22:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.76,1:22:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 我觉得还是\N把那些玩具给破坏掉比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.64,1:22:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 用用你的脑\N它们可以我们忙的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.26,1:22:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.51,1:22:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且又有了这扇门\N这里已经成了我们的天下了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.68,1:22:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社长 脑子真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.51,1:22:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们打算怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.10,1:22:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.35,1:23:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他们\N一定不会允许你们这么做的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.68,1:23:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们 他们真是可怜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.93,1:23:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.43,1:23:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.01,1:23:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死掉了?  你骗我的吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.93,1:23:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是实话 大雄掉到大断层下面
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.43,1:23:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他四个人...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.76,1:23:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香小姐呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.01,1:23:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停电啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.35,1:23:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有人关掉开关吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.30,1:23:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.64,1:23:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是寂寞 居然丢下我们不管
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.10,1:23:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的错 是社长啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.43,1:23:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.76,1:23:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们果然还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.51,1:23:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆 我们来救你了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.35,1:23:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.76,1:23:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 有鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.51,1:23:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小孩的幽灵出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.64,1:24:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  世界上哪里有幽灵
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.26,1:24:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道他们活着回来了\N快点抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.51,1:24:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 他好像发现了\N我们快点逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.30,1:24:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.43,1:24:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌云瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.43,1:24:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要躲进这个乌云里\N就会变成隐身
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.68,1:24:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让敌人看不到我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.35,1:24:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要喷了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.60,1:24:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我进来了\N- 眼睛好难过啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.26,1:24:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起跟着乌云跑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 小猪被救走了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.97,1:24:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 有个锁头在跑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.18,1:24:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.80,1:24:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定又用了什么道具
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.10,1:24:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点锁定锁头为目标
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.60,1:24:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃到森林里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.64,1:24:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 乌云散掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.93,1:24:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于露出你们的真面目了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.85,1:25:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点抓住他们 别让他们跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.60,1:25:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.43,1:25:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑到这里就突然不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.47,1:25:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还没跑远
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.76,1:25:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家分头仔细给我找是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.60,1:25:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦猫 快点出来 你们跑不掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.68,1:25:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有跟他们拼一拼了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.97,1:25:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你没有武器吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.18,1:25:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在树林里面 是不能用空气枪的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.26,1:25:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飘飘枪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.93,1:25:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是梦想魔幻乐园的那支枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.26,1:25:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是赠送的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.76,1:25:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.26,1:25:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.60,1:25:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.80,1:25:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.93,1:25:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跑了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.10,1:25:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.76,1:26:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪打它
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.64,1:26:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.60,1:26:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.85,1:26:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.43,1:26:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.93,1:26:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.14,1:26:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.35,1:26:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体突然浮了起来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.14,1:26:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.93,1:26:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.80,1:26:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 我的射击技术不错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.51,1:26:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.18,1:26:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点抬着他们两个\N通通逃到森林里面去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.60,1:26:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我记住
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.26,1:26:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.93,1:26:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.97,1:26:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.76,1:26:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你特地来救我们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.76,1:26:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小恐龙真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.85,1:26:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是技安的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.64,1:27:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫玩偶们一起回镇上去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.68,1:27:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.76,1:27:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.68,1:27:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为哆啦A梦他们的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.85,1:27:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又重新夺回发条都市
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.10,1:27:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但并不表示从此就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.51,1:27:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎他们远躲在森林里\N我们不能只是逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.26,1:27:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们同心协力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.76,1:27:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算武器很小也要跟他们打
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.01,1:27:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须用自己的双手\N来保护这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.76,1:27:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定 要坚持到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.43,1:27:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播种使者在离开的时候也曾说过
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.35,1:27:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠你们的力量来解决\N这点你应该知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.60,1:27:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是播种使者?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.76,1:27:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我掉到大断层时 所遇到的神仙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.30,1:27:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神仙?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.76,1:27:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个闪耀金黄色光芒的少年
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.97,1:27:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他不停变幻外形\N时而变成大魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.85,1:27:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来他是个神仙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.10,1:28:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫做播种使者啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.51,1:28:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 他说他曾经在火星跟地球上\N播下了生命的种子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.18,1:28:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但火星因为小行星的撞击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.80,1:28:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而没有生命延续
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.35,1:28:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个事情我听说过
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.60,1:28:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从火星落到地球上的陨石\N据说有生命的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.80,1:28:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播种使者在这个星球上\N播下了种子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.14,1:28:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来来如此啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.10,1:28:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也有责任保卫这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.26,1:28:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 你说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.26,1:28:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们要抓住鬼五郎\N把他带回地球上去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.76,1:28:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 小猴子有情报汇报
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.35,1:28:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎他们明天一早\N就要进行总攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.26,1:28:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们今晚好好休息\N明天准备应战
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.35,1:28:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.43,1:28:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.76,1:28:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.76,1:28:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要先吃点东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.60,1:28:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.26,1:29:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道鬼五郎他们会从哪里攻进来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.01,1:29:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要顾好自己的岗位
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.18,1:29:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄这一班负责蛋蛋屋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.35,1:29:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 小夫这一班负责商店街
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.35,1:29:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆这一班负责中央
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.26,1:29:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有任何状况都要马上通知我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.10,1:29:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.30,1:29:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.26,1:29:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然对手是小孩跟玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.10,1:29:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但绝对不能再饶过他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.76,1:29:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个的把他们解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.60,1:29:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何活口也不准留
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.30,1:29:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.14,1:30:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了 他们兵分多路
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.14,1:30:10.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安和小夫 你那有4个人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.76,1:30:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 好像有4个人\N往我们这边来了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.30,1:30:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4个人啊 绝不能放过他们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.10,1:30:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家上
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.80,1:30:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来躲在这里啊 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.26,1:30:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是骷髅 教命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.76,1:30:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位加油
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.76,1:30:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎 看招 抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.30,1:30:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.10,1:30:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你那里也有4个
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.76,1:30:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.93,1:30:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.14,1:30:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.93,1:30:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.43,1:31:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪给我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.43,1:31:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正面有5个人 皮姆我们准备上了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.68,1:31:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.43,1:31:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 他们人那么多\N我们打不赢的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.43,1:31:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说的 快点把他们给杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.14,1:31:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣先生 你怎么也在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.35,1:31:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么办法\N我也是鬼五郎的分身啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.26,1:31:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐 一个个都没用 用最后一招
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.18,1:31:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.85,1:31:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 森林着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.01,1:32:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么过份
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.93,1:32:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦猫咪 如果你不想让火势越大
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.76,1:32:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就马上向我投降
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.80,1:32:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去森林跟镇上\N都会化为灰烬的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.80,1:32:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 放大灯
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.43,1:32:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.68,1:32:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.10,1:32:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 鬼五郎逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.43,1:32:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去追\N- 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.60,1:33:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.97,1:33:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小木马 小木马
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.97,1:33:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎往哪里...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.30,1:33:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他往这里啊 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.93,1:33:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到他们\N比我想像的要难对付
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.80,1:33:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.14,1:33:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.26,1:33:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知天高地厚的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.68,1:33:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.30,1:33:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼 出来跟我一决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.10,1:33:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起来也没用
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.26,1:33:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.93,1:33:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小鬼到底躲在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.68,1:33:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里的植物们 挺身出来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.26,1:33:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.60,1:34:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.93,1:34:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕 救我啊\N我不会再做坏事了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.14,1:34:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你真是神枪手
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.60,1:34:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有的事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.64,1:34:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在感谢各位
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.47,1:34:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这些复制人\N又不能带回地球上去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.60,1:34:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要用复制蛋清理器\N把他们都清理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.85,1:34:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该只剩下一个人而已
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.97,1:35:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得自己好像重新活过来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.10,1:35:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给大家添了麻烦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.60,1:35:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你变成本体啦
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.35,1:35:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去地球上自首
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.64,1:35:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣先生
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.60,1:35:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意门
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.47,1:35:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 保重了 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.51,1:35:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下来要帮助发条都市恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.01,1:35:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这个星球就交给皮姆它们\N这样比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.43,1:35:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们偶尔来找你们玩
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.60,1:35:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.60,1:35:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆 波比 你们要加油哦\N我们会常来找你们玩
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.64,1:35:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香小姐 保重了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.80,1:35:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龙老弟 哥哥会在遥远的地球上
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.97,1:35:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈求你永远幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.76,1:36:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你未免太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.35,1:36:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木马 好好保重
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.47,1:36:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.93,1:36:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会再来的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.97,1:36:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.30,1:36:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会再来找你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.30,1:36:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.20,1:36:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有爱就够了\N爱だけあればいい
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.20,1:36:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都是 为你\Nすべては　For you
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.10,1:36:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荡漾在心中的思念\Nれるこの想い
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.10,1:36:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法抑止的爱\Nたまらなく　いとしくて
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.44,1:37:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦... 爱就是你\NLaLaLa... Love is you
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.71,1:37:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街上的风　也回应着我\N街は风の中　答えも
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.85,1:37:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那风中\NIn the wind
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.97,1:37:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使再沉重的悲哀\Nどんな悲しみも
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.97,1:37:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要关上心扉挡住\Nくい止めよう　心の手前で
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.40,1:37:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这泪水与笑容\Nと微笑みを
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.60,1:37:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一再上演的都市中\N缲り返すこの都?（まち）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.81,1:38:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都忘掉吧　就在此刻\Nすべてを忘れて　今は
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.87,1:38:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的我只想紧紧抱住你\N抱きしめたい
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.47,1:38:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱就是你\NLove is you
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.10,1:38:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这泪水与笑容\Nと微笑みを
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.10,1:38:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一再上演的都市中\N缲り返すこの都?（まち）

